        "Maria Lucia Limited Edition PCA 2025 — 6 × 52 Sublime, US$20 a cigar, US$200 per box of 10, limited to 1,000 boxes. Made at the Luciano Cigar Factory, Estelí",
        "Élevé — 2025 limited edition commemorating the founding of the Constella Group. 1,420 boxes of 10, the number drawn from the 142-year history of Fábrica de Tabacos Estrela in the Azores",
